  "limitations": [
    "Reconstructed decoded telemetry is not a byte-for-byte MAVLink packet recording.",
    "RAW_IMU unit assumptions apply to the current recorder; magnetometer fields are not asserted valid.",
    "Causal extrapolation intentionally suppresses pose for stale GPS/attitude; full frame coverage is not guaranteed.",
    "Ground-truth numerical differences reflect causal extrapolation vs offline interpolation, not absolute localization error.",
    "SDK MOTION SENSORS REQUIRED and occasional CORRUPTED FRAME warnings occurred in NET mode.",
    "The wall-time ZED wrapper logged TF_OLD_DATA after source rewind; the LR adapter cleared its buffers and required pipeline outputs recovered.",
    "Latency uses one host monotonic clock from /clock arrival to returned topic arrival, not exposure-to-display time.",
    "Existing RViz and verification subscriptions contribute to measured bandwidth; prediction publication is not a quality evaluation.",
    "Jetson system clock remains about nine days behind host; builds warn about clock skew.",
    "NET pause/seek, physical FCU/live camera, EKF localization and actuator control remain outside acceptance."
